            "review_title": "Review at Bánh mì 59",
            "review_text": "Donna B\n8 contributions\n0\nLocal banh mi cafe in Hanoi\nAug 2026 • Couples\nA lovely little local Banh mi cafe. The staff are welcoming to foreigners and can speak enough English to understand and be understood. The menus have English translations. The food is freshly prepared and charged at local prices. This was my first time trying bahn mi, and I was certainly not disappointed. I would recommend anyone visiting Hanoi looking for a fresh bhan mi to support this friendly local establishment.\nRead more\nWritten August 11, 2026",
